Package: rqrgibbs
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Bayes Interval-Root Regression with Gibbs Sampling
Version: 0.1.0.9023
Authors@R: c(
    person("Antonio", "De Leon", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jaguir26@ucsc.edu"),
    person("Raquel", "Prado", role = "aut"),
    person("Bruno", "Sanso", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Research implementation of loss-based interval-root regression
    for fixed designs, frozen deep echo-state-network features, and linear
    dynamic model embeddings. Ordinary relaxed quantile regression (RQR)
    supports native ridge, full Gaussian, and shrunken-shoulder horseshoe
    priors, observed-mask missingness, and exact checkpoint continuation. The
    normal-exponential construction augments an exponentiated interval loss
    and is not a response likelihood.
